          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Herdays Café is a refreshing new concept in the heart of Kirkby-in-Ashfield,  offering a welcoming space where wholesome living meets timeless design. Specialising in nourishing acai bowls, vibrant matcha blends, smoothies, and laid-back brunch offerings, the vision for Herdays is rooted in wellness, inclusivity, and connection. </p><p>The design direction embraces an organic and natural aesthetic, using soft textures, natural tones intertwined with the branding’s pink and greens, limewashed surfaces, and evergreen materials to create a calming, feel-good atmosphere for everyone. The space, including a thoughtfully designed café and accessible bathroom, is intended to be a gentle daily ritual that invites guests of all ages and backgrounds to relax, refuel, and feel at home.</p>",
