            "text": "<p>Simran Design was hired to offer design direction, consultation services, and sourcing services. We advised on the branding colour scheme and how this translated into the 3D space via materials and paint colours. We also sourced materials, lighting, loose furniture and accessories in the main cafe and washroom, including dining chairs, benches, tables, pendant lights, cushions and accessories, tiles, and wall decor. </p>",
